  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sub Dialogue 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Oh no! It seems the NETWORK FACTORY broke down! Don't worry, we can easily fix
    the problem.
  - A broken down building will not accept new resources until the problem has been
    acknowledged. By clicking on the red icon above the broken building, you can
    gain information about what went wrong. When you click on the information popup
    it will disappear and the building will be ready to accept new items once more.
  - If you need extra time to change the configuration of your factory without the
    items already on the conveyor belts getting in the way, you can always pause
    the game by pressing the pause button in the top left corner, or by pressing
    the Spacebar.
  - Click on the icon above the NETWORK FACTORY and find out what went wrong.
